  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  prompt: Interact
  noteTitle: "Apartment 3B \u2014 a letter, never sent"
  body: "Mother says there were always four of us in the family photograph.\n\nI
    count five.\n\nWhoever she is, she kept getting our post. The building ledger
    on the desk lists every mailbox on this floor \u2014 even the people nobody remembers."
  flagOnRead: 
  objectiveOnRead: Who is the fifth person in the Kerr family photo? Find her mailbox.
  hintOnRead: 
